Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI撤回ChatGPT Pro削减额度计划并宣布全线订阅档位用量翻倍</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Neuralink完成重大技术升级，Grok大模型正式接入脑机接口系统</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Mistral开源万亿参数模型Le Chonk：以更少Token实现顶级性能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini迎来重大功能升级，支持在对话中直接生成与编辑多格式文件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e45cf7981e103bc4cd953352c0009f75.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近日宣布Gemini对话式AI大模型迎来重大功能升级，正式推出文件内直接修改能力。即日起，用户在网页端与移动端即可对多种主流文件格式进行实时生成、预览及全屏编辑，无需导出即可完成深度修改。此次升级覆盖PDF、谷歌文档、谷歌表格、幻灯片、Markdown、TXT及代码文件。其中，PDF预览与编辑功能支持全屏模式，并支持选中文本定向提问及表格转图表等高级交互。其余格式目前主要落地于网页端。此次更新标志着Gemini从单一内容生成工具向沉浸式协作工作台演进，通过强化人机交互闭环，进一步提升AI辅助生产力的流畅度。这一趋势反映了当前大模型应用正加速向对话式办公场景渗透，有望重塑用户的数字工作流程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，支持8人同时识别</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，该模型采用MoE架构，总参数量340亿，每次前向传播激活43亿参数。其核心优势在于强大的多说话人分离能力，最多可同时区分8名说话人并实时判定归属。模型支持长达1小时的连续音频处理，涵盖40种语言转录及31种语言与英语的双向互译。在性能表现上，该模型在Open ASR英语组评测中词错误率（WER）低至5.33%，在Artificial Analysis非流式测试中WER进一步降至2.8%，位居开源榜单首位。Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe通过兼顾推理能力与运行效率，为开发者提供了处理会议纪要、跨国交流及复杂语音场景的高效基座，显著提升了多语种与多人对话环境下的转录准确度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI撤回ChatGPT Pro削减额度计划并宣布全线订阅档位用量翻倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于10月29日正式宣布，即刻上调ChatGPT Pro及Business Premium订阅服务的Work与Codex用量额度，Pro 100、Pro 200及Pro 500三档额度均实现翻倍，且新老用户同步生效，Dots常驻AI助理的扩展用量将独立计算。此前，OpenAI曾于9月29日计划以模型效率提升为由，将Pro 200额度削减约一半，此举引发订阅用户强烈不满。面对舆论压力，OpenAI最终撤回了削减计划，并明确承诺不会下调现有各档位的限制。官方同时提醒，额度翻倍并不等同于产能直接翻倍，实际消耗取决于模型选择、任务复杂度及上下文长度。特别是Fast模式与Ultrafast模式的额度消耗系数分别高达标准模式的2.5倍与8倍，重度用户在高频使用高速模式时，额度仍可能快速耗尽。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Neuralink完成重大技术升级，Grok大模型正式接入脑机接口系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4346e49eb882ea8c7f9302488390c497.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Neuralink近日实现技术突破，将Grok AI模型直接接入脑机接口，使患者能通过意念唤醒并操控智能体。在为期72小时的极限开发中，团队为P21临床试验患者Kenneth实现了8项功能。核心技术包括：神经语音活动检测（Neural VAD），实现零按键、纯意念的语音触发；实时神经信号可视化，辅助患者进行闭环神经反馈训练；以及系统级脑机输入法，支持在锁屏状态下通过意念秒级发音。最显著的进展在于Grok智能体的接入，患者默念指令即可唤醒Grok，由AI自动接管屏幕执行复杂操作，并将脑电信号合成语音接入iPhone通话。此次升级标志着脑机接口从单纯的“意念移动光标”迈向“意念操控AI”时代，通过引入大模型托管繁琐操作，有效解决了脑机接口带宽有限的瓶颈，实现了人机协同的深度融合。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral开源万亿参数模型Le Chonk：以更少Token实现顶级性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">欧洲AI企业Mistral正式开源代号为“Le Chonk”的旗舰模型Mistral Large4。该模型拥有1万亿参数，在欧洲本土基础设施训练而成。性能方面，其在FrontierCode2.0测试中获19.7%高分，并在Coding Agent Index中与GLM-5.3持平。核心优势在于极高的Token效率，完成同等编程任务的Token消耗较竞品减少47%。Mistral通过三周强化学习提供三种推理模式，以平衡性能与成本。安全层面，该模型在JailbreakBench等测试中拒绝率达96.6%，并向特定安全企业开放变体预览。Mistral Large4采用修改版MIT协议，允许免费商用，但MaaS企业需申请商业许可。目前模型已上线Hugging Face、Microsoft Foundry及NVIDIA</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
